OL,3,ARoyal Navy sailor in court accused of
OL,4,Apreparing to spy for Russia
OL,5,
OL,6,FA junior Royal Navy sailor accused of
OL,7,Fpreparing to spy for Russia has
OL,8,Fappeared in court.
OL,10,FAble Seaman Teddy Young, who
OL,11,Fspecialised in warfare intelligence,
OL,12,Fallegedly retained UK defence and
OL,13,Fintelligence material that he had
OL,14,Faccess to and made preparations to
OL,15,Fdisclose sensitive information, a court
OL,16,Fwas told.
OL,18,FThe 24-year-old appeared at Westminster
OL,19,FMagistrates' Court on Thursday after
OL,20,Fbeing charged under the National
OL,21,FSecurity Act.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
